{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "feat_audio",
  "kind": "flow",
  "commands": [
    {
      "op": "func",
      "name": "portraitNeutral",
      "params": [],
      "body": [
        {
          "op": "hide",
          "target": "lingfan"
        },
        {
          "op": "show",
          "target": "Images/角色/灵泛_正面.png",
          "id": "lingfan",
          "x": 860,
          "y": 110,
          "background": false
        },
        {
          "op": "style",
          "target": "lingfan",
          "props": {
            "width": 360,
            "height": 560,
            "stretch": "contain"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "call",
      "target": "portraitNeutral",
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "音频实例多轨站。实例是作者点名的编排单元，可多轨叠加、各自独立。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_play",
      "inst": "melody",
      "channel": "bgm",
      "resource": "Audio/bgm_theme.wav",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "loop": true,
      "fade": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_play",
      "inst": "wind",
      "channel": "ambient",
      "resource": "Audio/ambient_wind.wav",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "loop": true,
      "fade": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "两轨叠加：bgm 实例 melody 与 ambient 实例 wind 同时播放，互不干扰。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_volume",
      "inst": "melody",
      "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "把 melody 单独调到 0.8，wind 不受影响——实例音量独立。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_pause",
      "inst": "wind"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "只暂停 wind 一轨，melody 继续——实例暂停独立。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_resume",
      "inst": "wind"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "恢复 wind，从暂停位置续播，不从头重播。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "se",
      "resource": "Audio/se_ui_click.wav",
      "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
      "op": "se",
      "resource": "Audio/se_ui_confirm.wav",
      "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "se 通道一次性触发：点击音与确认音，不进实例、不可暂停。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "se",
      "resource": "Audio/se_type.wav",
      "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "打字音素材已备（se_type），此处一次性试听；逐字打字接线需宿主钩子，诚实缓办。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_play",
      "inst": "vox",
      "channel": "voice",
      "resource": "Audio/chest_drawer_open.mp3",
      "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "voice 通道实例 vox（既有素材占位演示通道；真配音素材缓办）。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_stop",
      "inst": "vox"
    },
    {
      "op": "audio_stop"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "停掉全部实例，声场清空。四通道与实例维度演示完毕。",
      "speaker": "灵泛"
    },
    {
      "op": "jump",
      "target": "feat_hub"
    }
  ]
}
